MC 1.21.1 Fabric Java Client
A Minecraft 1.21.1 Fabric modpack optimized for TLauncher.
---------------------------------------------
Details
This modpack has been specifically modified for TLauncher and includes fixes for compatibility issues with mods that do not work properly alongside the TLSkin & Cape mod.
Game Version: Minecraft 1.21.1 (Fabric)
---------------------------------------------
Installation
Download and extract the ZIP file.
Open File Explorer.
Click the address bar and enter:

%appdata%

Open the .minecraft folder.
Open the versions folder.
Copy the extracted modpack folder into the versions directory.
Launch TLauncher.
Select MC 1.21.1 Fabric Java Client from the version list.
Start the game.
--------------------------------------------
